{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q27252228","formula":"C₁₂H₁₆BNO₅S","hill":"C12H16BNO5S","elements":["H","B","C","N","O","S"],"composition":{"B":1.0,"C":12.0,"H":16.0,"N":1.0,"O":5.0,"S":1.0},"names":{"en":"Vaborbactam","ru":"Vaborbactam"},"descriptions":{"en":"Vaborbactam (INN) is a non-β-lactam β-lactamase inhibitor discovered by Rempex Pharmaceuticals, a subsidiary of The Medicines Company. While not effective as an antibiotic by itself, it restores potency to existing antibiotics by inhibiting the β-lactamase enzymes that would otherwise degrade them. When combined with an appropriate antibiotic it can be used for the treatment of gram-negative bacterial infections.","ru":"Ваборбактам — лекарственное средство подавляющее действие β-лактамазы. Используется в комбинации с другими антибиотиками: Меропенем (Vabomere) — одобрен в США в 2017 году как лекарственное средство для лечения сложных инфекций мочевыводящих путей и пиелонефрита."},"fame":8,"pubchemCid":56649692,"mass":297.14,"charge":0,"smiles":"B1([C@H](CC[C@H](O1)CC(=O)O)NC(=O)CC2=CC=CS2)O","inchikey":"IOOWNWLVCOUUEX-WPRPVWTQSA-N","iupac":"2-[(3R,6S)-2-hydroxy-3-[(2-thiophen-2-ylacetyl)amino]oxaborinan-6-yl]acetic acid","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"rdkit","ref":"56649692","atoms":36,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":0.744,"y":0.522,"z":-0.739,"el":"B"},{"x":0.369,"y":-0.232,"z":0.616,"el":"C"},{"x":1.269,"y":-1.473,"z":0.741,"el":"C"},{"x":2.763,"y":-1.152,"z":0.5,"el":"C"},{"x":2.994,"y":-0.125,"z":-0.659,"el":"C"},{"x":1.865,"y":-0.039,"z":-1.515,"el":"O"},{"x":4.223,"y":-0.524,"z":-1.49,"el":"C"},{"x":4.538,"y":0.518,"z":-2.518,"el":"C"},{"x":4.091,"y":0.405,"z":-3.691,"el":"O"},{"x":5.292,"y":1.633,"z":-2.166,"el":"O"},{"x":-1.041,"y":-0.622,"z":0.613,"el":"N"},{"x":-1.817,"y":-0.7